      <div class="faq-cta">
        <h2>Still have a question?</h2>
        <p>Reach out to our team for anything related to Colour Stone Rings, custom designs, or wholesale requirements.</p>
        <a href="/pages/contact-us" class="btn-gold">CONTACT US</a>
