    ["What are Natural Colour Stone Rings?","Natural Colour Stone Rings feature naturally occurring gemstones with their own individual color and characteristics. Natural variations in clarity and inclusions can make each gemstone look unique."],
    ["What are Certified Gemstone Rings?","Certified Gemstone Rings are accompanied by gemstone documentation or a certificate where applicable. Certification can provide information about the gemstone's identity and certain quality characteristics."],
