    ["Can I order Custom Gemstone Rings?","Yes, Custom Gemstone Rings can be created according to your preferred gemstone, metal, size, setting, and design. Custom orders can be discussed based on individual or business requirements."],
    ["Can I get Custom Gold Gemstone Rings?","Yes, Custom Gold Gemstone Rings can be designed using your preferred gemstone, gold color, karat, ring size, and design. Additional diamonds or gemstones can also be considered depending on the design."],
    ["What are Personalized Gemstone Rings?","Personalized Gemstone Rings can include details such as initials, names, dates, symbols, or specific gemstone choices. They can be created to match a personal style or special occasion."],
